  caseId: investigation_longline_01
  displayName: The Missing Predator
  briefing: A modern eDNA survey shows a repeated shark non-detection, tuna at more
    sites, and repeated krill non-detection. Compare overlapping ecosystem models
    before writing a report.
  surveyContext:
    surveyId: survey_12
    surveyDisplayName: Survey 12
    siteId: seamount_a
    siteDisplayName: Seamount A
    processedSampleSummary: Processed eDNA results from shallow, mid and deep samples
